  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6204.01 Certification Examination Fees",
  "priorExpiration": "2002-03-04",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6204.01 Certification Examination Fees.\n\n(a) The division shall charge a $30.00 fee for any retest given to a student who has failed a written certification examination or single station practical examination.\n\n(b) The division shall charge a $75.00 fee for any retest given to a student who has failed the entire practical examination.\n\n(c) Any student who fails to appear for a retest of a certification examination shall be charged a $20.00 fee, unless notification is given at least 5 hours prior to the examination.\n\n(d) The division shall charge actual expenses incurred to any organization which completes a certification course that is not coordinated or funded by the division.\n\nSource. #7552, INTERIM, eff 9-5-01, EXPIRED: 3-4-02\n\nNew. #7747, eff 8-17-02; ss by #9496, eff 6-26-09; ss by #12477, eff 2-8-18 (formerly Saf-C 6203.01)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6200.html"
